      "paperId": "eb574698c5010f34b390ffe7ee48c16b365c6015",
      "title": "The Archimedean point: Consciousness, praxis, and the present in Luk\u00e1cs and Bloch",
      "authors": [
        {
          "name": "C. Moir",
          "authorId": "145717470"
